### Agent scratch space ###
# Throwaway files go in .scratch/ at the repo root, never in /tmp or another
# external temp dir. See AGENTS.md. The folder is kept so it always exists;
# nothing inside it is tracked.
.scratch/*
!.scratch/.gitkeep
